Sval: a tab hover preview anchored to the Workspace panel's row

Firefox's tab hover preview opens against the tab element and draws its
own picture, for loaded tabs only. Sval hides the tab strip and shows the
preview from the Workspace panel's rows, so TabPanel.activate takes an
optional source naming the element to anchor to, the popup position and
the picture to show, an element or none. A tab in the strip passes none
and is drawn as before. No chrome API sets the anchor or the picture of
the panel set Firefox owns.

